  "summary": "Consolidated checkpoint of the initial harness lifecycle build: dev collapsed into one 6-stage skill (Context Gathering, Ceremony, Plan, Implement, Test, Document), the full design lifecycle flow (Frame..Publish, adaptive interfaces, quality gates), war and evolve each collapsed into one $ARGUMENTS-routed skill, legacy per-stage helpers retired, the portable patch-history contract itself, and independent dev/design metrics CLIs. Replaces 8 superseded bundles (1eec015b, e0691d4e, e9c4f190, a852e4b5, 7c1d8d0a, 1853ae79, 4b39f5ba, a7e5f673) whose stored diff payloads had drifted from canonical content; this bundle re-derives every path from current, disk-verified canonical content instead of replaying the old (partially inconsistent) diffs.",
